            "title": "Cyber Monday: Consumers expected to spend record $14.2 billion",
            "description": "<p>The online shopping deals aren't stopping as consumers search for value on Cyber Monday. Adobe Analytics expects shoppers to spend $14.2 billion in Cyber Monday purchases, up 6.3% from last year.</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance senior retail reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/brooke-dipalma/\">Brooke DiPalma</a> takes a look at spending trends, while looking ahead to the major retailers expected to report earnings this week.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
