            "title": "Salesforce earnings, September PCE, auto sales: What to Watch",
            "description": "<p>Market Domination Overtime host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/jared-blikre/\">Jared Blikre</a> previews several of the biggest stories to come throughout next week, including earnings results from companies like Salesforce (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRM\">CRM</a>), Macy's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/M\">M</a>), and Hewlett Packard Enterprise (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/HPE\">HPE</a>); the release of September's long-delayed PCE index (Personal Consumption Expenditures), the Federal Reserve's preferred inflation gauge; and the latest reading of auto sales.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination-overtime/\">Market Domination Overtime</a>.</p>",
